{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "kokoro",
  "chunk_id": "kokoro-chunk-0101",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00598",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我刚要站起来告辞，只好又坐了下来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I was just about to stand up and take my leave, but I had no choice but to sit down again.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00598",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "在谈话告一段落之前，我一直充当他们两个人这段对话的听客。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Until the conversation reached a stopping point, I remained a listener to the exchange between the two of them.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00599",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“你怎么想？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"What do you think?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00599",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "先生问我。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Sensei asked me.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00600",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "是先生先走，还是夫人早亡，都不应该由我来判断，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Whether Sensei would die first or his wife would pass away earlier was not something I should judge,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00600",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我只好笑了笑：“寿命这东西，我也说不好啊。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so I could only smile and say, \"As for lifespan, I really cannot say.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00601",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“寿命还真是没办法啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"There really is nothing one can do about lifespan.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00601",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "人出生时就注定了能活多少年，无法改变的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "How many years a person will live is fixed at birth and cannot be changed.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00601",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "你知道吗，先生的父亲和母亲，差不多是同时去世的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Did you know that Sensei's father and mother died at almost the same time?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00602",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“是去世的日子吗？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Do you mean the day they died?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00603",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“日子相同太难了！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"It would be too unlikely for the day itself to be the same!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00603",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "不过前后差不了几天，是相继去世的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But it was only a few days apart; they died one after the other.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00604",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "这倒是闻所未闻的新鲜事，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This was something new, something I had never heard before,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00604",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我觉得有点纳闷。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and I felt a little puzzled.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00605",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“怎么会同时去世了呢？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"How did they come to die at the same time?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00606",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "夫人正要回答，却给先生拦住了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "His wife was about to answer, but Sensei stopped her.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00607",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“别说这些了，没什么意思。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Let us not talk about that. It is not very interesting.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00608",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "先生故意吧嗒吧嗒地摇着手中的团扇，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Sensei deliberately rattled the fan in his hand,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00608",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "然后又转过头来看着夫人，说：“静，我要是死了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "then turned back to his wife and said, \"Shizu, if I die,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00608",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "这所房子就留给你吧。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I will leave this house to you.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00609",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "夫人笑了起来：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "His wife laughed:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00609",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "“顺便把地皮也给我吧。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Then give me the land as well.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00610",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“地皮是人家的，没办法给你。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"The land belongs to someone else, so I cannot give it to you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00610",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "但是，我的东西全都给你。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But I will give you everything that is mine.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00611",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“谢谢了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Thank you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00611",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "可是那些洋文书，给了我也没用啊。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But those foreign-language books would be no use to me even if you gave them to me.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00612",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“卖给旧书店嘛。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Sell them to a secondhand bookshop.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00613",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“能值几个钱！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"How much could they possibly be worth!\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
